{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y压缩了人物最终的独立性落点，尤其删去了X中“即使一直没有，也愿意自己好好过下去”这一层，使结尾的自我支撑显得稍弱。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点词有明显视觉层级，感受又按音乐实际进程出现，不必同时处理一大堆短词，普通观众更容易边听边抓住要点。它对音色、节奏、旋律回返、力度变化和情绪转折的描写也更具体细腻。X的叙事动机交代得更充分，尤其人物从怀念、动摇到能够独自生活的心理变化更完整，因此在人物理解和整体故事闭合度上略胜。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d54fd5c0-9ad2-4de7-82d1-d43bf35bdeb1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T090336955037Z", "elapsed_seconds": 91.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:05:08.090357+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "030176f04004e07c95aa5726e1dbfd9fc20d549f1d063451c5d9f3baabf88347", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885